                "text": "I refuse to accept an America that allows Black women to die from pregnancy complications at three times the rate of their white counterparts. We\u2019ve lost far too many Black mothers to these health disparities to sit idly by under this sickening status quo. \n\nThis Black Maternal Health Week, join me in saying enough is enough. Because it\u2019s time to make the health of Black mothers a priority.",
