                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yet again, this is another setback for maternal health...@SCOTUS has set equitable healthcare for women back decades with this ruling. \n\nThis is a cruel and direct attack on our most vulnerable populations. \n\nThis decision will put the lives of women in this country in danger and impedes on millions of Americans receiving essential medical care.",
