                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump's Big Ugly Bill will have devastating impacts on everyday Americans. While House Democrats are voting NO, we just need four of our colleagues across the aisle to have the guts to do the same. \n\nHear from one of my constituents Richard whose daughter's health is being put in grave danger just to fund tax breaks to the President's billionaire buddies. \n\nIt's not too late to call your representatives and let them know they must vote \"NO!\"",
