                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I hosted a very important roundtable discussion to bring awareness to uterine health, where I was honored to be joined by @Lupita_Nyongo who shed light on her own experiences with the severe impacts of uterine fibroids. Our conversation was filled with tears and a myriad of emotion from women who are dealing with this disease, and I am eternally grateful that she took this moment to share her story and lend her powerful voice to the voiceless.\n\n\u201cAs a young girl, you\u2019re taught to deal with pain at an early age. We are taught to suffer in silence. I\u2019m speaking out because silence serves no one.\u201d \u2014 Lupita Nyong\u2019o.",
