                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In observance of Fibroid Awareness Month, my colleagues and I hosted a Uterine Health Awareness press conference to advocate for the health of women nationwide. I am proud to stand with my sisters,\n@RepShontelBrown, @RepBonnie, and @Sen_Alsobrooks to reintroduce a myriad of legislation to support research and preventative measures to end uterine cancer and fibroids.",
