                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This Sunday, join me and @WinWithBLKWomen for a conversation addressing the harmful effects of the passage of the Big Ugly Bill, and the reintroduction of my Uterine Health legislative package in observance of Uterine Fibroid Awareness Month. It's always a pleasure to join my sisters #WinWithBlackWomen to discuss issues impacting our communities.",
