                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The @CDCgov shakeup isn\u2019t just bureaucratic\u2014it\u2019s a direct threat to the health and well-being of our nation. \n\nKennedy is not fit to serve in this role, like so many of his Trump appointed colleagues placed within federal agencies. \n\nIt is dangerous and reckless to play politics within this department.\n\nUndermining science and public health experts puts every community at risk. We need a CDC that will meet infectious diseases head on and not weakened. \n\nAmerican lives depend on it!",
